From: Luo Jie <quic_luoj@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: qca8084: implement SerDes probing and link configuration

QCA8084 PHY package needs to do the PHY package clean up, add
phy_package_remove_once helper to support.

QCA8084 PHY package integrates the XPCS and PCS, which is used to support
10G-QXGMII. XPCS includes 4 channels to connect with Quad PHY, and PCS
controls the interface mode configured.

When QCA8084 works on 10G-QXGMII, the XPCS and PCS need to be configured in
the PHY package init function.

When the link of PHY is changed, the XPCS channel needs to be configured to
adapt the current link status.

Merged from:
  0309-net-phy-Add-phy_package_remove_once-helper.patch
  0310-net-phy-qca808x-Add-QCA8084-SerDes-probe-and-remove-.patch
